            "review_title": "Review at The Kebab",
            "review_text": "Tom F\n1 contribution\n0\nAmazing...like I was back in Europe\nJul 2017 • Solo\nI've tried many Kebabs in Hanoi and by far this was the best, the owner learned how to make Kebabs in Europe and it shows, plus the price is great, I highly recommend it, it's also close to the cathedral so it's a great stop on a walking tour of the old quarter and Hoan Kiem lake. Definitely try it out. Great food, great quality, great prices.\nWritten July 31, 2017",
